WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:01.330
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:05.400
<v><b>A:</b></v> The New York Times, please.

00:00:05.746 --> 00:00:06.465
<v><b>B:</b></v> Here you are.

00:00:06.962 --> 00:00:07.666
<v><b>A:</b></v> How much is it?

00:00:08.232 --> 00:00:09.589
<v><b>B:</b></v> It’s six dollars.

00:00:10.045 --> 00:00:10.898
<v><b>A:</b></v> Card OK?

00:00:11.165 --> 00:00:11.662
<v><b>B:</b></v> Sure.

00:00:15.761 --> 00:00:16.326
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:17.934 --> 00:00:21.721
<v><b>A:</b></v> Excuse me, how much are those umbrellas?

00:00:22.192 --> 00:00:23.916
<v><b>B:</b></v> They’re 15 pounds.

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:27.061
<v><b>A:</b></v> Ah, OK, no thanks.

00:00:27.373 --> 00:00:31.458
<v><b>B:</b></v> Right, please yourself, love, tourists.

00:00:35.102 --> 00:00:35.787
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:38.177 --> 00:00:40.372
<v><b>A:</b></v> A charger, please, for this phone?

00:00:40.724 --> 00:00:42.976
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, here you are.

00:00:43.165 --> 00:00:44.809
<v><b>A:</b></v> Thanks, how much is it?

00:00:45.444 --> 00:00:47.366
<v><b>B:</b></v> Eight pounds forty-nine.

00:00:48.075 --> 00:00:48.574
Bag?

00:00:49.075 --> 00:00:49.965
<v><b>A:</b></v> No, thanks.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:54.655
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:57.016 --> 00:00:59.417
<v><b>A:</b></v> A single to Oxford, please.

00:00:59.997 --> 00:01:02.467
<v><b>B:</b></v> Thirty pounds twenty p, please.

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:03.509
<v><b>A:</b></v> Here you are.

00:01:04.174 --> 00:01:04.725
<v><b>B:</b></v> Thank you.